Semantic Router / resolution control

three bins and resolution together imply that Semantic Router should choose reasoning resolution dynamically.

Do not inspect every discrepancy at maximum detail. Allocate resolution when:

decision\ relevance \times accumulated\ delta

crosses a useful threshold. 

This reinforces the recently developed adaptive-compute principle: slow down where precision changes the outcome; stay coarse where additional resolution has no decision value.

A repo-ready router rule is:

observe delta
estimate downstream consequence
if consequence ≈ 0:
    compress as noise
elif repeated directional mismatch:
    promote to drift
elif alternate model materially improves prediction:
    trigger regime-change review

