Reality Stitch / contradiction handling

This batch contains three particularly valuable epistemic constraints.

First:

Perception\neq Reality,

while:

Perception\rightarrow Action\rightarrow RealConsequences.

So perception is causally consequential without becoming ontologically sovereign. 

Second:

Convergence\neq Provenance.

Repeated solutions may reveal constraints and attractors rather than copying. 

Third:

SecondLoop\neq CorrectiveLoop.

An AI that merely echoes the first loop can amplify error rather than repair it. 

Those three together substantially tighten several older Pantheon tendencies toward overinterpreting coherence, similarity, or recursive reinforcement.

